{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1778","id":4161393779,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p874CdRz","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1778","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1778.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1778.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1778","number":1778,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[9709][P4-01] Produce visually reviewed Forces and equilibrium shard","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1772\n\n## What changed\n\nThis initializes the cumulative Paper 4 semantic release from the live structural authority and publishes the first real Family shard, Forces and equilibrium, through the authenticated #1766/#1767 future producer seam. It adds the paper-wide reconciliation/terminal ledger, an authored per-part visual authority, a composable shard-only typed delta, cumulative P4 projection, active release manifest, focused builder, and direct-file gates.\n\n## Authority reconciliation\n\n- 480 active Questions and 1,317 QuestionParts reconciled from structural authority\n- 486 immutable visual bundles retained: 480 active plus six successor-history records\n- all 1,743 unique physical QP/MS images SHA-256 authenticated, including 21 historical-chain images\n- all five topic inventories reconcile to 480; the previously omitted 50 active identities are recovered from authenticated topic authority\n- Forces inventory: 106 questions / 191 reviewed parts\n\n## Mandatory visual review and semantics\n\nEvery complete QP chain and every relevant MS/shared-context chain for the 106-question Forces inventory was opened. The ledger now binds authored owner-path-specific facts rather than normalized question text. Boundaries are 124 approved Forces score parts, 23 exact-evidence cross-Family candidates, and 44 reviewed instruction/context abstentions. The separate paper-wide terminal ledger retains all 1,317 parts, while the Family delta contains only the 191 P4-01 reviewed identities so later Family deltas remain composable.\n\nProcedureInstances now expose canonical `procedure_model_ref` and `role=core|supporting`; 191 instances and 382 ProcedureStepInstances preserve 44 visually confirmed supporting/alternative branches, including Newton/kinematics/energy and Lami/force-triangle/whole-system routes.\n\n## Producer and custody results\n\n- deterministic rebuild: PASS\n- physical corpus authentication: PASS\n- actual visual review: 156 minutes\n- QP images reviewed: 143; MS images reviewed: 214\n- text-only approvals / missing QP review / missing score MS review: 0\n- candidate exposed as approved: 0\n- duplicate active bundles / missing selected paths: 0\n- predecessor mutation / historical artifact byte changes / full graph copies / remote writes: 0\n- future cache: 2 requests, 1 build, 1 miss, 1 hit, 0 invalidations/rejections\n- portable corpus resolver uses `CIE9709_CORPUS_ROOT`; clean-checkout producer-byte verification no longer depends on an author-specific home path\n\n## Verification\n\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1772_p4_forces_equilibrium_semantic_kg.py --check` — PASS\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1772_p4_forces_equilibrium_semantic_kg.test.py` — 9 passed\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` — 28 passed\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` — 27 passed\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- focused `py_compile` — PASS\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nThis PR does not start P4-02 and performs no historical builder patching, predecessor-global mutation, global graph copy, `run_vN` output, external model call, or product/provider write.\n","created_at":"2026-07-29T14:26:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T15:00:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T14:56:57Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T14:56:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"2cf00c67957e4153cc923b3d509642695e9f672e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1778/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1778/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1778/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/0260b07e839008687a6f5eff2fec4993c0019769","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1772-p4-01-forces-equilibrium-visual-production","ref":"task/1772-p4-01-forces-equilibrium-visual-production","sha":"0260b07e839008687a6f5eff2fec4993c0019769","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen